# Brep2Code Core (L0)

## Before any task

1. Read root `AGENTS.md`
2. New session: run skill `handoff-resume` or read latest `docs/handoff/active/`
3. Design background: see `docs/links/paper-vault.md` (link only, do not copy paper content)

## During work

- Prefer Skills in `.cursor/skills/` over ad-hoc workflows
- Architecture decisions → ADR under `docs/architecture/adr/`
- Repeatable steps → update `docs/runbooks/`
- Q01–Q04 status lives in paper vault; this repo tracks implementation status in `docs/architecture/pipeline.md`

## Before ending a session

- Update Handoff in `docs/handoff/active/` (skill `handoff-create`)
- Do not git commit unless the user explicitly asks
